---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import JsonLd from '../components/JsonLd.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profileImage from '../../public/assets/images/profile.webp';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jay Shah — Senior Data Scientist at 6sense, building production AI applications, foundational model systems, and agent evaluation frameworks">
  <JsonLd type="Person" />
  <article class="prose prose-kolam dark:prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
    <header class="not-prose mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-6 mb-6">
        <!-- Profile photo with kolam frame -->
        <div class="relative shrink-0">
          <div class="absolute -inset-3 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-gold/40 dark:border-gold-light/30"></div>
          <div class="absolute -inset-5 rounded-full border border-terra/15 dark:border-terra-light/15"></div>
          <!-- Cardinal accent dots -->
          <div class="absolute -top-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-terra/30 dark:bg-terra-light/30"></div>
          <div class="absolute -bottom-5 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-terra/30 dark:bg-terra-light/30"></div>
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 -left-5 -translate-y-1/2 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-terra/30 dark:bg-terra-light/30"></div>
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 -right-5 -translate-y-1/2 size-1.5 rounded-full bg-terra/30 dark:bg-terra-light/30"></div>
          <div class="rounded-full size-[88px] overflow-hidden ring-2 ring-white dark:ring-night-800 shadow-lg">
            <Image
              src={profileImage}
              alt="Jay Shah"
              width={88}
              height={88}
              class="size-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-ink dark:text-silk carved-heading">Jay Shah</h1>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase text-ink-muted dark:text-silk-muted mt-4" style="letter-spacing: 0.12em;">
            Senior Data Scientist &bull; 6sense &bull; AI Applications &amp; Foundational Models
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <p>
      Senior Data Scientist at <a href="https://6sense.com">6sense</a>. I train foundational models with custom embeddings to power high-scale intent intelligence, deploy model explainability in production, and build contextual knowledge graphs linking buyer personas and intent signals. I also architect LLM agent evaluation frameworks used across the engineering and product organizations.
    </p>

    <p>
      At 6sense, I work on intent intelligence: foundational models with custom embeddings, model explainability, contextual knowledge graphs, and evaluation systems for large language model agents. The hard part is rarely choosing a better model. It is dealing with noisy signals, changing behavior, unclear definitions, and knowing whether a system is still trustworthy after it ships.
    </p>

    <p>
      Before 6sense, I built retrieval-augmented generation systems, Model Context Protocol agent platforms, anomaly detection products, and foundation-model operations at <a href="https://avathon.com">Avathon</a>. Some of that work supported more than 20 agent workflows and reduced model release cycles by 45%. Earlier, I worked on energy forecasting and failure prediction systems, including anomaly detection work that contributed to more than $500k in savings.
    </p>

    <p>
      My graduate research at Texas A&M focused on predicting wind-energy failures. That experience gave me a lasting rule: a model that works in a notebook has made a promise, not proved anything.
    </p>

    <p>
      I write about the systems I build, the assumptions behind them, and the parts that usually break. If something is on this site, it shipped or I learned enough from it to explain what happened.
    </p>

    <h2>Outside the Terminal</h2>

    <p>
      Cricket comes first. Tea, never coffee. Yoga is the habit that survived a newborn's sleep schedule.
    </p>

    <p>
      I care about Indic languages and culture, especially the gap between the languages people speak and the languages most AI systems understand. Gujarati Llama started as a personal project because useful language technology should not be limited to English-speaking users.
    </p>

    <p>
      I also read outside machine learning: systems thinking, philosophy, and energy policy. Some of my best technical ideas began as questions from another field.
    </p>

    <h2>Honors & Awards</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Winner at Ragathon by LlamaIndex (Feb 2024)</li>
      <li>Outstanding Master's of Science Student (Apr 2019)</li>
      <li>2nd Runner-up at Texas Datathon by Citadel (Feb 2018)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Patents</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230213560A1/en">Calculating energy loss during an outage</a> — US20230213560A1, Filed Dec 30, 2021</li>
      <li><a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US20230214703A1/en">Predicting energy production for energy generating assets</a> — US20230214703A1, Filed Dec 30, 2021</li>
      <li><a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/IN201721044402A/en">Dimension Measurement Using Image Processing</a> — IN 201721044402, Filed Dec 11, 2017</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/jayshah5696"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-cream-300 dark:border-night-700 rounded text-sm text-ink-light dark:text-silk-muted hover:border-terra hover:text-terra dark:hover:text-terra-light transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://linkedin.com/in/jayshah5696"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-cream-300 dark:border-night-700 rounded text-sm text-ink-light dark:text-silk-muted hover:border-terra hover:text-terra dark:hover:text-terra-light transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          LinkedIn
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://huggingface.co/jayshah5696"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-cream-300 dark:border-night-700 rounded text-sm text-ink-light dark:text-silk-muted hover:border-terra hover:text-terra dark:hover:text-terra-light transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          Hugging Face
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://cv.jayshah.dev"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-cream-300 dark:border-night-700 rounded text-sm text-ink-light dark:text-silk-muted hover:border-terra hover:text-terra dark:hover:text-terra-light transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          Resume
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
